ng new era\, debuting as a solo artist. River's reputation for writing galv
 
anizing\, strikingly honest lyrics\, and their penchant for tapping element
 
s of Indie rock and pop have forever cemented them as a country artist who 
 
energetically pushes the boundaries of their genre into a new frontier. Riv
 
er has delivered fiery fusions of country music and rock n' roll all over t
 
he USA\, Canada\, and Europe\, selling out headlining shows at home and abr
 
oad. Whether they're backed by a full band or appearing as a duo\, River Sh
 
ook is hitting the road in 2026 with their unmistakable voice\, a growing c
 
ollection of brand new songs\, smoking talent\, and the promise of real\, r
 
aw\, unforgettable live shows. Onstage and off\, River Shook isn't just an 
 
artist -- they're a force of nature. Please Note: All Sales Final. Two Item
 
